# Artist's Talent, level 3: "If a source you control would deal noncombat damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent
# controls, it deals that much damage plus 2 instead." (CR 614.1, 120.3.) After the three turns it takes to reach level 3, Bot1:
# Lightning Bolt to Bot2's face deals 5 (20 to 15); Lightning Bolt to its own face deals only 3 (17 to 14: "an opponent");
# Burst Lightning, 2 damage, kills Bot2's Picklock Prankster (toughness 3) because the damage is 4 (an opponent's permanent);
# and Embereth Shieldbreaker's combat damage is only 2 (13), not 4. Bot2's own Lightning Bolt on turn 6 deals the 3 it prints
# to Bot1, a source Bot2 controls (20 to 17).

